      "backersCount": 156,
      "percentFunded": 400,
      "risks": "We spent lots of time with our suppliers, but things could still go wrong from time to time. Therefore, please give us bit more trust if time table is off, since we want to make good quality product onto your hands.",
      "story": "<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53751583\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/751/583/774edc896b81fd859c52c07b4fb10a55_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778917079&amp;width=680&amp;sig=MXr%2FdYZryBqY590iB%2FPk2urzbMzmsExzahb%2BjUklFLg%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:A-reusable-bag-people-actually-love-to-use-again\" class=\"page-anchor\">A reusable bag people actually love to use again</h3><ul>\n<li>We never realize how much we depend on disposal shopping bags, until a real crisis hits the world. But reusable grocery bags are nothing new, why people weren't using them? Because people always<strong> forget to bring </strong>the reusable bags at check-out, and the <strong>thin handle or straps hurts hand</strong> or shoulder, especially when loaded with heavy items.</li>\n<li>Wouldn't it be great for a reusable bag to have a<strong> thick &amp; comfortable handle</strong>, and can be <strong>packed so small </strong>that people bring it around all the time ?</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"h:-Meet-Weei-bag-\" class=\"page-anchor\"> Meet Weei bag :)</h3><ul><li>We designed Weei bag to be able to be packed into a super small size.</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754033\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/033/7ff1e85cf5895b7162235aea639cec48_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778944649&amp;width=680&amp;sig=b9HRzVpsOx%2BEyZmo9K0kivkfnDpS1idBLAv4%2Bgiawnk%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>When u need it, Weei bag can be <strong>unpacked into a full size tote bag.</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766566\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/566/cf95f8f85ea383e039984b7474b0e40c_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779073609&amp;width=680&amp;sig=1Z4m3jZVKuJqURNQXq8Op%2FUMJK7Y0qHbLr7D8gQQdfg%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>And the<strong> soft pack-cover can transform into a strap padding :)</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53773762\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/773/762/a1489be0998ab5d2ae9df56a8abd7a94_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779115343&amp;width=680&amp;sig=0c1MW%2BTQDJu%2FBcIfEEwOmXBOhrnklOsOyL4XKCRHuyc%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:International-shipping-tax-friendly\" class=\"page-anchor\">International shipping &amp; tax friendly</h3><ul><li>Our<strong> shipping rate is quite reasonable</strong> to EU, UK, USA, and most Asian countries, mostly about<strong> 0 to 5 US dollars</strong>, and for most cases we<strong> already included tax</strong> within the reward price, so please click the reward to check the shipping rate for your area, we are sure you will find it <strong>within your budget :)</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53753469\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/753/469/f75d99c5f537cfa280b1b898ff34816f_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778938917&amp;width=680&amp;sig=RINxvHgIfIZVl9t1lyearhC3SP37K7g3Hk8GbCA4P%2BE%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754203\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/203/5247b846506f5a2f892d16d9c2fcce79_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778945796&amp;width=680&amp;sig=RrI2SHNh3gxkdpebxjwtdFNTAGOGsesjdaC5pV4EDeQ%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53753473\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/753/473/458da43cfb16fd489e76ded5d7eb62e2_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778938957&amp;width=680&amp;sig=%2Fv6qNDQtB%2FUmSXxZ3B1QwkO9%2B086KVz0lCkSl2zfNaM%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:A-bag-that-s-always-there-when-u-need-it\" class=\"page-anchor\">A bag that's always there when u need it</h3><ul><li>Weei bag is super handy as <strong>shopping bag, back-up travel bag, a beach trip bag, or a simple daily tote bag</strong> for minimalists. It can be packed into a very small size that you can easily take it with you all the time, and unpack to <strong>use it whenever you need.</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53760327\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/760/327/1e9ff0219e77939614eb4c8cd77f3c51_original.gif?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779020196&amp;width=680&amp;sig=dnI5nPhnobLSft3uHe28Vh%2F6U%2FpFIbBcfEezqT%2BFpXk%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>The weight of Weei bag is merely around<strong> 40 grams (1.4 oz)</strong>, that's about of the weight of an AirPod, and its size is also just slightly bigger than an AirPod, therefore it can<strong> easily fit into pants' pocket.</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53761026\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/761/026/8cf9e102ff418a17406d2894c4d6429d_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779027250&amp;width=680&amp;sig=OoG8GfqCfO%2BUhyrdMhP4AiSL9KRyUtFEYr4WhHslgF8%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766437\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/437/3320000ee96efb5e2174a74489268685_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779072863&amp;width=680&amp;sig=bJFAKr4gTqUM2mrKJmfDKxsTuPY8kI%2F0mh9X%2BNRUdyg%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>Weei bag in packed mode has a <strong>little loop</strong> for hooking onto a key-chain, backpack, or a shop cart. </li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754375\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/375/d3c5a3b2e1b652663d29533218fbc0a7_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778947140&amp;width=680&amp;sig=KDaXnqsDdFbdmrG3FjF4wK77550u%2BEoCidpZq%2BfcC0I%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>Weei bag also comes with<strong> a default little metal hook</strong> for clipping onto a shopping cart, or other bags. And of course, the metal hook can be removed from the bag or replaced by users' own hooks.</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766529\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/529/b58bb7bd2c774f6aaf49aba928a4613a_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1779073413&amp;width=680&amp;sig=0rwQPj54wxsl%2B%2BRij%2BKfRnKYinI1gIHrd2cVXhsefbw%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>There is <strong>also a loop on the side of the Weei bag</strong> in unpacked mode, for attaching the pack cover or anything else. </li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766518\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/518/c4da5a5e4c64d0147c8bc51888eed19d_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779073302&amp;width=680&amp;sig=DPRLD9BMgF3aeuQQzECLPGYJmO8f3exoDkuw%2FodGWW0%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53745097\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/745/097/f69d9db9ef66f11c594d34abb8619374_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778861837&amp;width=680&amp;sig=4Hzfn%2FQjgMOw7176HNCWfHIP59QOqhB9JHUgW4Sepf8%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:No-more-hand-shoulder-pain\" class=\"page-anchor\">No more hand / shoulder pain</h3><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766591\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/591/72713a9ad9a9a288e0fbad3256529908_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779073828&amp;width=680&amp;sig=dGHuPCwMvz37LQC1H%2B3RX2uNbWjHfibxR5eTnxAcBys%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>One of the most unique feature of Weei bag is the design of its pack cover. The pack cover is made of soft yet tough material (diving suit material), and there are 4 buttons at each corner, therefore<strong> it can be fold in 2 ways, vertically and horizontally. </strong>\n</li>\n<li>Once <strong>fold vertically</strong>, the pack cover turns into a cubic shape for <strong>holding the bag in packed</strong> mode. And when<strong> fold horizontally</strong>, the pack cover transform into a <strong>bar shape, </strong>and can be used as an insert cushion for the handle.</li>\n</ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754494\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/494/3a16a8004b3f394e55c7e57043f22f61_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948068&amp;width=680&amp;sig=%2FXFL5MTGxp1CzuPPJ%2B5B4C6kD02WWHZrxnjOP5oOVSQ%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:How-to-insert-\" class=\"page-anchor\">How to insert?</h3><ul><li>We made a<strong> small pocket beneath the strap </strong>of Weei bag, and the bar shape pack cover can be insert into this pocket, and become the <strong>padding of the strap.</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754501\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/501/98d8ffb58436f0567166d5b35eb3d1b1_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948101&amp;width=680&amp;sig=YPPloISoLO9l%2FBrv3whQBX9JdoVZlsaEThoeNjsA1dg%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>With the insert cushion, the padded strap is now<strong> thick, soft, and will not lose shape</strong>, providing a much better and <strong>comfortable carrying experience</strong> either by hand or by shoulder. </li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754508\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/508/1121a69142e27175b0425fdf0139bc9b_original.JPG?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948214&amp;width=680&amp;sig=%2BgTUI0OC83fMabjVgCB3grmm8DWQVbDYZ%2FFB7agOs2k%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>All existing shopping bags claims to have wide handle to distribute pressure, in theory, but the fact is no matter how wide the handle starts with, it <strong>will lose shape under pressure, and collapse</strong> into thin strings that hurts skin. </li>\n<li>With Weei bag, the strap now is padded with thick soft cushion, and always holds its shape. N<strong>o more pain, no more afraid of heavy loads or longer walk.</strong>\n</li>\n</ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754510\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/510/03ff06cea9e6141d3aa8c5ca93ebdc4e_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948240&amp;width=680&amp;sig=Oq1iBIRIL%2B5mhi%2FMYzQK4yZi%2BHgUC%2Bq3U4fliw1dcbk%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>Weei bag can be <strong>even more comfortable than most full-size hand bag</strong>, and we are very proud of this design :)</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754525\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/525/77b3e4617dd55d27ff797d3d22d4b757_original.gif?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948402&amp;width=680&amp;sig=XRn%2B6sGX9rMN3yVuUBv6XP5Z2G3G9gJJGKtjR8rUTsg%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766421\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/421/02a9674f3849ee290942ee8a2e127ee0_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779072803&amp;width=680&amp;sig=oODBoWp%2FL8LY5LXLtchXqesnMODyBxCg53Kg2oOOgIQ%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:Holds-up-to-20-lbs\" class=\"page-anchor\">Holds up to 20 lbs</h3><ul><li>The main material of Weei bag is<strong> high quality nylon, </strong>light weight, easy to clean, and <strong>very tough and durable. </strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754586\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/586/d536aab118a9d739c698d5e32155161f_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948862&amp;width=680&amp;sig=xs4YnFNsIcCwfUMKsZ7hT%2Fk77FHY5P2Py0Fvqg6apF0%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>The structure of Weei bag is also carefully designed, so that it can <strong>handle quite some weight, up to about 10 kg or 20 pounds. </strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53754580\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/754/580/f6066c926bbe02b188951812ec2338fd_original.gif?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1778948834&amp;width=680&amp;sig=89bw8%2BrqhfyEQ42Vhz%2FIc2TDM7%2Ffoc4LdvZwi%2FL6AUE%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:12L-capacity-or-more\" class=\"page-anchor\">12L capacity or more</h3><ul><li>The dimension of <strong>Weei bag is about 35cm by 40cm by 8cm, </strong>with about 11 to 12L capacity. Ideal for a quick grocery run, or as a travel back-up bag, etc.</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53788478\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/788/478/7f1b3b09a7fe4fa9aacd85dd55fc0dba_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779197347&amp;width=680&amp;sig=OryshdQunHaRnXtKwn4ZHXmCf1%2BpesT8e6ks7dlOF0U%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>Weei bag's top is wide open, so in theory, if can fit even more than 12 L.</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53774602\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/774/602/e2b3d0321d370e37030fb8f0b2f20234_original.gif?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779118907&amp;width=680&amp;sig=Rmlg6o4Sg2qaVLD%2BP8p1ia2qXyQFD1BrIKmq4UUaPUI%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:Will-multiple-bags-fits-inside-one-pack-cover-\" class=\"page-anchor\">Will multiple bags fits inside one pack cover?</h3><ul>\n<li>If one bag is not enough, could one pack cover be able to hold multiple bags? Well, the up limit is about <strong>3 to 4 bags per pack cover.  </strong>\n</li>\n<li>To be clear,<strong> each and every Weei bag comes with a pack cover. </strong>Info here is only for referrance, to those who may want to carry multiple bags within one pack cover.  </li>\n</ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53784664\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/784/664/1e45a2503b2d34724d97e99259e1acee_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779180460&amp;width=680&amp;sig=RH4UnJ7kuadqP8WZcrFbILEtG7%2FQ2KSlGXpCdV2lJA8%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53766432\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/766/432/e5461efcedb350b0df60b4925a70217d_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779072834&amp;width=680&amp;sig=C7dbtPjQxmITEBFj%2Bwa6fcZ9nhuACnp9yGzjAv8Xtm4%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:Stylish-tote-bag-\" class=\"page-anchor\">Stylish tote bag </h3><ul><li>Weei bag can be carry as a sling tote bag. Ideal for a walk to park or beech :) </li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53762216\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/762/216/2b146020fea4857de15dda315e5456e6_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779036527&amp;width=680&amp;sig=RzXqgtKjl2Li19VFqm5s0d1iZyIlH5jW21TUGwC%2FOmA%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>Want to carry like a hand bag? No problem, Weei bag looks <strong>quite premium and stylish.</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53762222\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/762/222/3c74f5814df477f4fca809fda322a4d7_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779036554&amp;width=680&amp;sig=80l3sfmkP5G7u8V4bMDb%2FaDlVxIsXGtf5wqRu21O2ns%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>Of course, Weei bag can be carried by hand, especially when the bag is relatively heavy, and the <strong>padded handle is super helpful.</strong>\n</li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53762319\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/762/319/da9c1ca9b3daa9b5235b69ff07dd68ea_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779037213&amp;width=680&amp;sig=ThcAf15ILvWxm2%2FQed4le7KZYiMrPi3tiCZZFltKM3Q%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53762348\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/762/348/e6a8b2213e9dfb9723008d53e2797176_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779037576&amp;width=680&amp;sig=%2FMwNSe57O4an3H3Aw0muJ60CztCp0zsjzAYMg2Oo%2F7o%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>We offer 5 colors,<strong> blue, green, grey, orange, purple</strong>. We don't offer black color since it reminders us of trash bag. :( </li></ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53762351\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/762/351/088a41dde949c12b03352d685df58fbf_original.JPG?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779037603&amp;width=680&amp;sig=xi7KEYvaPDTJABdRH7hptn%2FgSuVG9pyxRYLgVhKqwB4%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<ul><li>As for the color of the pack cover, it will be <strong>a matching color with the main bag</strong>, the one we show on the campaign page is the matching color for grey. We will share more info with update later on. :)</li></ul><h3 id=\"h:12-USD-per-bag\" class=\"page-anchor\">12 USD per bag</h3><ul>\n<li>Generally, we offer Weei bag for kickstarter backers for 12USD per bag, as Early bird price with amount limit. Future retail price would be about 14 to 15 USD per. </li>\n<li>And on top of that, we also offer limited<strong> buy 3 get 1 FREE, and buy 4 get 2 FREE</strong> reward as special thanks to kickstarter backers, come and claim them now :)</li>\n<li>Also, if you want even more bags to share with your family or friends as gifts, you can<strong> add more bags through Add-on reward</strong>. :)</li>\n</ul><div class=\"template asset\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-alt-text=\"\" data-caption=\"\" data-id=\"53775075\">\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fit\" src=\"https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/053/775/075/dbe61bc23f132af232bf9d907c7800a3_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=92&amp;v=1779121150&amp;width=680&amp;sig=XBJ4v8ygLpWwNxwzybNhGFXf5maVsm8rTxenNw3u9fQ%3D\">\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h:Production-plan\" class=\"page-anchor\"><strong>Production plan</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Over all, Weei bag is <strong>relatively simple to make, therefore it won't be that much of a challenge </strong>for our manufacturer. And we will make sure the stitches are carefully crafted, and properly enhanced according to our requests. <strong>We are confident that we can handle the production.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Usually, it takes about 2 weeks to collect backer order info, and we will then order materials, make cutting tooling, then move to production test, which takes about another 2 weeks. The final production should be finished in about 3 weeks, so about 6 to 7 weeks in total for production. Then we will start to arrange labeling and shipping, which should take about 2 weeks. After we ship the packages, we will be sending tracking info to each backer one by one.</li>\n</ul>",
